{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03929","headline":"奉和人日宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制 · 韦元旦","name":"奉和人日宴大明宫恩赐彩缕人胜应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鸾凤旌旗拂晓陈，鱼龙角觝大明辰。\n青韶既肇人爲日，绮胜初成日作人。\n圣藻凌云裁栢赋，仙歌促宴摘梅春。\n垂旒一庆宜年酒，朝野俱欢荐寿新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦元旦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}